<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Digital raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Digital raised.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cowen Corp analyst Richard Chu said he raised his 1998 earnings per share estimate on Digital Equipment Corp and his recommendation on the stock.</p>
<p>- Chu said he raised Digital's 1998 earnings per share estimate to $2.75 from $2.45. Digital reported on Thursday earnings per share of 0.68 for 1997.</p>
<p>- Chu raised his recommendation on Digital stock to strong buy from neutral, and said the stock could climb to the mid-50s from $41.75 at mid-afternoon on Thursday.</p>
<p>((Michael Ellis, Boston bureau, (617) 367-4176))</p>
